{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人梁杰文於節目中推介海底撈(6862)，指內需股表現強勁，順勢買入，而早前公布的中期業績不俗，股價相對落後。另外，追求派息的話，目前股息率逾7%。</p><p></p><p>梁杰文建議10.1元買入，目標價看12元，止蝕價定於8.8元。</p><p></p><p>海底撈(6862)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$10.1</p><p>目標：$12</p><p>止蝕：$8.8</p><p></p><p>股評人阮子曦推介小米集團(1810)，市場料零部件價格即將見頂，可能對小米手機的毛利帶來改善，另外集團新車銷售火熱，都令股價較其他重磅科網股稍微強硬，但要關注公司快將公布業績，業績方面未必帶來提振。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Yw7bH0vV121794981178.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>阮子曦認為現價29.5元便可買入，目標價看35元，止蝕價在26.5元。</p><p>小米集團(1810)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$29.5</p><p>目標：$35</p><p>止蝕：$26.5</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260QDTNlyzGs1794981175.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.628265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:21.374590+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:00.461579+00:00","content_hash":"449cda02bb41cd366a24c3a9f2f36d1301f015bff31e3aaae4e7584ca79ed424","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.628265+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}